      <dico>Lessing</dico>
      <unicode>ᠰᠥᠰᠥᠺ</unicode>
      <uighur>süsüg</uighur>
      <cyrillic>сүжиг – сүсэг - сүзэг</cyrillic>
      <transcript>SYSYG</transcript>
      <definition>[= syzyg] n. Religious worship, faith, belief, piety; reverence.</definition>
      <page>745</page>
      <examples>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠰᠥᠰᠥᠺ ᠪᠢᠰᠢᠷᠡᠯ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- bisirel</transcript>
          <definition> Faith, devotion, piety.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠰᠥᠰᠥᠺ ᠶᠡᠺᠡ ᠎ᠲᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- jeke tei</transcript>
          <definition> Very religious, pious.</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠰᠥᠰᠥᠺ ᠦᠭᠡᠢ</unicode>
          <transcript>-- ygei</transcript>
          <definition> Having no religious faith, infidel, unbelieving; atheistic</definition>
        </example>
        <example>
          <unicode>ᠴᠣᠬᠤᠷ ᠰᠥᠰᠥᠺ ~ ᠮᠤᠬᠤᠷ ᠰᠥᠰᠥᠺ</unicode>
          <transcript>coxur -- = muxur -- </transcript>
          <definition> Superstition; blind faith.</definition>
        </example>
      </examples>
    </entry_item>
